  },
  {
    num: "03",
    title: "180° Himalayan Peak Backdrop",
    description: "Fresh mountain air and unobstructed views of Nanda Devi and Trishul stimulate clarity, reduce burnout, and foster creative problem-solving.",
    icon: Mountain
  },
  {
    num: "04",
    title: "Standalone Leadership Villa",
    description: "A 3-bedroom Alpine Villa with a stone fireplace living room functioning as an executive boardroom and VIP accommodation for founders and CXOs.",
